---

<div
    class="flex justify-center pl-[8.4%] pr-[8.4%] pt-[20rem] pb-[10rem] xl:text-2xl bg-cover bg-no-repeat"
    style="background-image:url('images/02_Image_BG_01.webp');"
>
    <div class="max-w-[1400px] xl:max-w-[2000px]">
        <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 px-0 py-[4rem]" id="design">
            <h2 class="text-6xl py-3 font-light mb-5">Design</h2>
            <p class="py-3 text-3xl font-light text-[#cb8337] lg:pr-48 mb-6">
                The Mazda CX-60 and Mazda CX-90 combine the sporting looks and
                abilities expected from top-of-the-range SUVs.
            </p>
            <p class="py-4 font-light lg:pr-[17rem]">
                Mazda's ascent into the realm of premium automotive design is
                not merely about offering luxury features, it's a holistic
                philosophy that encapsulates the essence of what the brand
                stands for: innovation, craftsmanship, and the seamless
                integration of form and function.
            </p>
            <p class="py-4 font-light lg:pr-[17rem]">
                Building on the "Stylish, Insightful, and Spirited" axiom
                adopted by Mazda in the early 2000s, Mazda’s "Kodo – Soul of
                Motion" design language is a concept that evokes emotion and
                passion.
            </p>
            <p class="py-4 font-light lg:pr-[17rem]">
                The long bonnets and short rear proportions encapsulate a sense
                of vitality and sophistication, drawing inspiration from the
                incredible RX-VISION concept.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div
    class="w-full text-white flex flex-col bg-cover bg-left bg-no-repeat"
    style="background-image:url('images/03_Image_BG_01.webp');background-color:#060103;"
>
    <div
        class="bg-[#00000094] flex justify-center backdrop-blur-xl[z-index:100] border-b-black border-b"
    >
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row max-w-[2000px]">
            <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 pl-2">
                <img
                    class="relative inline-block my-4 md:my-0 [top:-100px] md:[top:-40px] px-12 md:px-20"
                    src="images/02_Image_Still_01.webp"
                    alt=""
                />
                <img
                    class="relative inline-block md:[top:auto] [top:-50px] md:[bottom:-40px] px-12 md:px-20"
                    src="images/02_Image_Still_02.webp"
                    alt=""
                />
            </div>
            <div
                class="w-full md:w-1/2 md:pl-2 md:pt-[140px] pb-10 px-[10%] md:pr-[10%] xl:pl-12"
            >
                <p class="font-light py-4 text-2xl text-[#cb8337] mb-4">
                    The distinctive front grilles, detailed headlamps, and wide
                    bodies communicate power and agility, with seamlessly
                    flowing exterior lines that contribute to an efficient
                    aerodynamic profile.
                </p>
                <p class="font-light py-4">
                    These new models position the cabin further to the rear,
                    enhancing the sense of motion, presenting a silhouette that
                    is attractive from every angle.
                </p>
                <p class="font-light py-4">
                    This is complemented by the boldness of light play along the
                    side, mirroring the expressiveness found in Japanese
                    calligraphy and modern art.
                </p>
                <p class="font-light py-4">
                    The Mazda CX-60 is available exclusively in a five-seat
                    configuration, while the Mazda CX-90 has been designed from
                    the ground up as a premium three-row six or seven-seat
                    model.
                </p>
                <p class="font-light py-4">
                    Whichever you choose, you won’t need to compromise on
                    comfort, space, or the driving experience.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div
        id="interior"
        class="w-full mt-20 pb-24 pl-[8.4%] pr-[8.4%] flex justify-center xl:text-2xl"
    >
        <div class="max-w-[2000px]">
            <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 px-0 py-[4rem] xl:px-20">
                <h2 class="text-6xl py-3 font-light mb-5">Interior</h2>
                <p class="py-3 text-2xl font-light text-[#cb8337] mb-6">
                    The Mazda CX-60 and Mazda CX-90 continue the theme of
                    refined elegance, with high-quality materials, meticulous
                    craftsmanship, and a driver-centric layout that is true to
                    Mazda's human-centric design philosophy.
                </p>
                <p class="py-4 font-light">
                    The extensive use of natural materials, with tactile and
                    visual warmth, sets the Mazda CX-60 and Mazda CX-90 apart
                    from Mazdas that have come before, while the panoramic
                    sunroof – a first for Mazda – bathes the cabins in natural
                    light.
                </p>
                <p class="py-4 font-light">
                    The seats in the Mazda CX-60 and Mazda CX-90 are something
                    special. Mazda has moved the game forward with a design
                    that's all about supporting you, literally, from every
                    angle.
                </p>
                <p class="py-4 font-light">
                    Whether you're cruising down the highway or tackling twisty
                    turns, the ergonomic seats make sure you're nestled in
                    comfort, while keeping you in tune with the car's movements.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<style>
    @media (min-width: 767px) {
        #design {
            background-size: 137%;
        }
    }

    @media (min-width: 1900px) {
        /* Your styles for screens above 2000px width */
        #designLowerBlock {
            padding-bottom: 23rem;
        }
        #design .content-still-2-left {
            padding-left: 10rem;
            padding-right: 12rem;
        }
    }
</style>
